   title = "AI Agent Orchestration + Notification Recovery"
   description = "Two-layer AI agent strategy (in-app agents: HelpDesk/Beekeeping/Ency; operational agents: Email agent + Secretary agent running outside the app via Hermes/cron, migrating to the AI editor). Reuses the existing production-health/error-audit -> DB -> DailyPlan signal. Restores the regressed in-app + system notification channels (only email works today). Adds a user-VoIP-number config page (successor to the old Perl4 'call a page') so the Secretary can text/voice/browser-call the user for critical reminders."
