<div class="container">
    <h1 class="doc-h1">AI Agent Orchestration + Notification Recovery</h1>

    <div class="last-updated" doc-muted>
        Last Updated: 2026-08-19 | Version: 0.1 | Status: DRAFT (approved for authoring) |
        Tracked in project: <a href="/project/details?project_id=267" class="doc-link">#267 (AGENTS — Autonomous Agents, job-specific)</a>
    </div>

